@baseUrl = https://localhost:7043

### API liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json

### SQL Server readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ready
Accept: application/json

### Public shelters: no citizen locations or allocations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shelters
Accept: application/json

### Current verified public alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/alerts
Accept: application/json

### Protected operations and authentication are documented in Swagger and docs/api/contracts.md.
### Use the generated local demo password; never save credentials in this file.
